OL,3,AHungarian MPs scrap Orban's anti-LGBTQ
OL,4,Ameasures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Hungarian parliament has voted to
OL,7,Famend child protection laws, scrapping
OL,8,Fmeasures that stigmatise gay and
OL,9,Ftransgender people. LGBTQ and human
OL,10,Frights activists warmly welcomed the
OL,11,Fmove, but called for changes to other
OL,12,FOrban-era laws.
OL,14,FThe 2021 Child Protection Law, passed
OL,15,Fby the large Fidesz majority of
OL,16,Fthen-Prime Minister Viktor Orban,
OL,17,Fbanned the "portrayal or promotion of
OL,18,Fhomosexuality or transgenderism".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
