OL,3,AHungarian MPs scrap Orban's anti-LGBTQ
OL,4,Ameasures
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince Orban's April election defeat,
OL,7,Fthe Tisza government of Peter Magyar
OL,8,Fhas been working to dismantle the
OL,9,Fprevious government's legacy.
OL,11,FMinutes after Tuesday's vote, Budapest
OL,12,Fsaid the EU had agreed to release
OL,13,FbB,4.2bn (#3.5bn) of funds frozen in
OL,14,Fthe last years of the Fidesz
OL,15,Fgovernment.
